.claude/

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
# *.pdf            # see note below before un-commenting

# Rendered Markdown — auto-generated from the root .md docs; too noisy to track.
# Anchored to root so Flask/Jinja templates (e.g. CodeBench/week_13) stay tracked.
/CLAUDE.html
/README.html
/COMP_1510_Status.html

# Secrets — never commit credentials
.env
*.key

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
# Imported legacy source decks (root only) — reference material, never commit
/COMP1510_*.pptx

# Firebase service-account key — never commit
service_key.json

# Office lock/temp files
~$*
